{"games":[{"id":7933242294,"name":"[☢️] Stud Walls Jump Per Difficulty Chart Obby","desc":"👋 Welcome to Mythz's Wraparound Per Difficulty Chart Obby! In this game you must jump around walls. Each wall gets longer by 0.5 studs! What is your limit?\n\n🔴 SHUTDOWN = UPDATE / BUG FIXES 🔴\n\n📜 UPDATE LOG 📜\n- Coins! (Buy various cosmetics in shop like halos, trails and titles with coins)\n- Rebirths (Rebirth once you complete the game and compete for the leaderboards)\n- Troll products! (Troll others by purchasing products like nuke, explode all, low gravity, speed, and fog!)\n- New lobby!\n\n🔢 Current stages: 121\n\n💰 50% OFF on Gamepasses for a LIMITED TIME! 💰\n\n💖 JOIN our group for a special \"Supporter\" chat tag in-game: https://www.roblox.com/groups/4425994\n\n[TAGS]: Simulator, Stud, Jump, Obby, Parkour, Tycoon, Fun, Mega, Easy, Colorful, Victory, Platformer, Pets, Clicker, Gifts, Rainbow","path":"/game/7933242294-stud-walls-jump-per-difficulty-chart-obby","slug":"7933242294-stud-walls-jump-per-difficulty-chart-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b8173f0236de5b0eeb25baa31f012b46673697764e87f7009135100ee3f9f0ae.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8247b3368915eaa449e1adc4f7c2657e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50550152,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-06T12:24:02.093Z","creator":{"name":"MythzRB","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8365905206,"name":"untitled tag game [beta]","desc":"A work in progress game of Tag with advanced movement including climbing, sliding, rolling, vaulting, swinging, and more! Currently, there are 13+ unique gamemodes, 12+ maps, and more! \n\nClick to tag C to slide \nC when landing to roll \nSpace at an edge to climb \nSpace when colliding with a \nSwingBar to swing \n\nWe are currently in development of a full remaster with loads more content and polish. You can access the early version of this in the lobby! \nPlease join our Communications Server to provide feedback as we read all of it and it helps us a ton!","path":"/game/8365905206-untitled-tag-game","slug":"8365905206-untitled-tag-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/51e8fc406bb9c247077ae654d87fb1cc4847ac17d54aa5a5d5d82feac09e97ef.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-04cd806dcdf26d400b3fb4671772bce2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":72554162,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-26T15:24:43.055Z","creator":{"name":"_create","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8649501395,"name":"NFL Tycoon","desc":"Hey Team! \r\n\r\nNFL Tycoon is being sunset for the exciting launch of Super NFL Tycoon. All players who played NFL Tycoon will be awarded with in-game currency when joining the new game. All players who purchased the 2x currency gamepads will also have the same in the new game.  Thank you!","path":"/game/8649501395-nfl-tycoon","slug":"8649501395-nfl-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d44db4ac87d4de73963222598af7c046d9676cbe8c3472df00187013b569172b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-69d3deb2006abcd1cceec5f1c6131cb8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":7987207,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-05T23:01:27.446Z","creator":{"name":"NFL","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7703947631,"name":"Akumu [Horror]","desc":"Today, we are starting to revamp the whole Akumu game with a new name and stories. \r\nI will appreciate your patience with a new major update. Join our community server to see more announcements soon!\r\n\r\nA traditional folktale that deceived many into believing immortality was possible to achieve. A doomed man who instead summoned \"Her\". Venture into the woods and find out the horrifying truth to this folktale.\r\n\r\nJoin our community through the Social links\r\n\r\nThis game is inspired by The Mimic\r\n\r\nTags: Geisha, Samurai, Mimic, Horror, Survival, Ghost, Spirit, Evil, Scary, Multiplayer Horror, Monox","path":"/game/7703947631-akumu","slug":"7703947631-akumu","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2d39537caf3323765710dfb45f2104eb478785ed0b8fe7e7dfaccd78a0d660c9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-315b73fcfc0b86af6ce2844ea9ada1bf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":20244074,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-19T09:30:04.314Z","creator":{"name":"Kursed Incorporated","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7622046644,"name":"Monster Ghoul(MOBILE/PC)[2X EXP][FIXED STAT][BETA]","desc":"Welcome to Monster Ghoul, an immersive experience where your choices shape your destiny. In this thrilling universe, you are invited to choose your allegiance:\n will you walk the path of the Ghouls or align yourself with the CCG (Commission of Counter Ghoul).\n\n\nFAQ\n\n-Killing player with high level could possibly earn high reputation\n\nFor computers press 1 to 9 to use your kagune/quinque \n\n\"V\" - Quinx or Arata Joker\n\"X\" - Sprint\n\n\n⚠️XBOX is still beta⚠️\n\nXBOX CONTROLER LIST👇\n\nHold L2 + Square = E\n\nHold L2 + Triangle = R\n\nHold L2 + Cycle = F \n\nHold L2 + X = C\n\nHold L2 + L1 = V\n\nHoldL2 + Up Button = Switch Detahcments/QuinX\n\nR2 = normal click\n\nR1 = dash\n\nUp button = Sprint\n\nDown button = shiftlock\n\nLeft button = N (Equip Arata)\n\nRight button = Mask\n\n\nNormal X = Jump\n\n\nDo not attempt to exploit the system, as our auto-detection will identify such actions, and we do not entertain appeals for bans.","path":"/game/7622046644-monster-ghoul","slug":"7622046644-monster-ghoul","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4da21cd7ef28c825752cc538f002f629ae0e5058f3f3321f69d3da013f0f379e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1606aa35295af445a149b98d7008ceca/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":38334193,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-26T02:14:48.024Z","creator":{"name":"iBlackButterfly","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8479386309,"name":"Egg Hunt 2022: Lost in Time","desc":"Welcome to your grand journey, great eggventurer! Upon finding a mysterious crystal in a cavern, you unknowingly unleash a great evil that threatens not only the jungle, but the entire timeline. Will you be able to take on the challenges ahead in order to conquer your journey victoriously?\n\nTake on the pesky rabbit Hopper as you traverse through the jungle; helping the residents, peculiar animals, and locating every last egg to power an advanced device & take back the timeline from chaotic madness!\n\nThis passionate project would not have been achieved without the creative inspiration from Egg Hunt 2018: The Great Yolktales, developed by the talented Fifteam.\n\nThis is a community-developed unofficial Egg Hunt experience, all egg rewards are in-experience ONLY and will NOT be reflected in your Inventory. We appreciate your understanding. Happy hunting! 🐇\n\n\nAnimation - DeepAquaticBlue\nScripting - DeepAquaticBlue & Programmables\nGame Producer - DeepAquaticBlue & InnovationTime\n","path":"/game/8479386309-egg-hunt-2022-lost-in-time","slug":"8479386309-egg-hunt-2022-lost-in-time","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c699a0dd6794ee4989fd631503204940577cc1075816bd989620a2d297849fee.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6fe2b71bfa61fd8a5eadc487d40e5813/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2216718,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-05-28T05:40:08.415Z","creator":{"name":"Egg Hunt 2022: Lost in Time","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7462526249,"name":"NIKELAND🏀","desc":"","path":"/game/7462526249-nikeland","slug":"7462526249-nikeland","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/150/150/Unap